  "body": "Some homes just feel good the moment you walk in. This is one of them!\r\n\r\nFacing northwest and looking straight out over the park, this freehold townhouse gets great sunsets.\r\n\r\nThree generous bedrooms are filled with natural light, and the master suite sits upstairs with its own fully tiled ensuite and a view across the green park. Downstairs, a second ensuite makes the guest bedroom properly private, ideal for a flatmate or work-from-home opportunity. Three bathrooms in all, every one fully tiled.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is the heart of the place. Engineered stone benchtops and quality tapware make it a pleasure to cook in, and it opens onto a large deck that flows straight off the living area. Picture a coffee in the morning sun, or friends over on a Saturday evening with the park stretching out in front of you. Inside, the open-plan layout keeps everyone connected, whether it's a quiet night in or a full house.\r\n\r\nPeace of mind comes built in, with a balance of the Master Builders Guarantee still to run, and an internal-access garage gives you secure parking and additional room for a workbench or extra storage.\r\n\r\nThe location does a lot of the work for you. Schools, shops and public transport are all within walking distance; the motorway interchange is close for an easy commute, and Orewa Beach is just around the corner. Weekdays run smoothly, and weekends feel like a holiday.\r\n\r\nWhether you're buying your first home, growing a young family, looking to downsize, or adding a solid property to your portfolio, this one suits you. \r\n\r\nBook your viewing today and see how good it feels for yourself. Be quick! Call Rosalind 0212431153\r\n\r\n*****\r\nDisclaimer: While every effort has been made to ensure the accuracy of these particulars, no warranty is given by the vendor or the agent as to their accuracy. Interested parties should not rely on these particulars as representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise. Although high standards have been used in preparing this document, no legal responsibility can be accepted for any loss or damage resulting from the content or use of this information. Any photographs show only certain parts of the property as they appeared when taken, and some photographs may have been digitally enhanced for marketing purposes. Areas, amounts, measurements, distances, and all other numerical information are approximate only.\r\n\r\nNote: Every care has been taken to verify the accuracy of the details in this advertisement. However, its accuracy cannot be guaranteed. Prospective purchasers are requested to take necessary action to satisfy themselves with any pertinent matters.",
